&oe=6AA011B4"}, "display_name": "OowOah VR Meeting Room & Quantum Leap", "keywords": ["VRMeeting", "VRMeetings", "VirtualMeeting", "VirtualMeetings"], "long_description": "Step into a fully immersive VR meeting experience with OowOah \u2014 built to go beyond traditional platforms like Zoom and Teams. OowOah places you inside a true virtual meeting room where you can connect, collaborate, and present as if you were physically together.\n\nKey features include full-size presentation screens for impactful presentations, AI-powered main meeting notes that automatically capture key points, and personal note-taking tools so every participant can track their own ideas. Navigate naturally in VR, interact with others in real time, and stay fully engaged without the limitations of flat screens.\n\nOowOah also includes organisation and team management, the ability to run multiple meetings, and scalable meeting spaces based on your needs. With the unique Quantum Leap feature, you can bring real-world environments into the meeting, creating powerful remote collaboration experiences.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest headsets, OowOah removes the need for travel while delivering a far more engaging, focused, and productive way to meet.\n\nTo set up your business account go to   https://www.oowoah.com and click set up account.", "short_description": "Step into a fully immersive VR meeting room with OowOah \u2014 the next evolution beyond Zoom and Teams. Host meetings, deliver presentations on big screens, and capture AI-powered notes, all within interactive virtual spaces that bring people together like never before.  To access the admin panel please go to https://www.oowoah.com/"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://high5vr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OowOah", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.high5vr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags"